<title>USA: TABLE - Foremost Corp Q2 net rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Foremost Corp Q2 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>GRAND RAPIDS, Mich. 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr primary		$1.47		    $0.93</p>
<p> Net			 13,550		    9,295</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary	 9,246		    9,961</p>
<p>	  SIX MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr primary		$1.96		    $0.92</p>
<p> Net			 18,359		    9,211</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary	 9,361		   10,003</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1997 Q2 and six months include income from discontinued operations of $90,000, or $0.01 a share.</p>
<p>1996 Q2 includes loss from discontinued operations of $586,000, or $0.06 a share, and 1996 six months includes income from discontinued operations of $383,000, or $0.04 a share.</p>
<p>Q2 realized gains from continuing operations $3,518,000, or $0.38 a share, vs $912,000, or $0.09 a share.</p>
<p>Six months realized gains from continuing operations $4,518,000, or $0.48 a share vs $1,410,000, or $0.14 a share.</p>
<p>Full name is Foremost Corp of America.</p>
</text>
